# Prompt text box

When the user asks for a prompt to paste into a new chat, agent, or other tool, put that prompt in one fenced code block.

- The block contains only the prompt. No title, preamble, or commentary inside the fence.
- Use a `text` fence so the copy button copies the prompt alone.
- Keep any explanation outside the fence, and keep it short.
- One prompt, one block. Do not split the prompt across several fences.

```text
Rewrite the sniffer in Rust. Follow ADR 0001.
```
